      "text": "\"Beats Claude Opus 5 on specialized benchmarks.\" Who picked the benchmark?\n\nNVIDIA shipped the Nemotron 3.5 open-weight family today: Super VL 120B for agents, Bolt 74B plus a tiny E4B, Transcribe 30B covering 40 languages. Some outlets ran with \"5x faster than Opus 5.\" Another",
