      "text": "Day 19: \"Open weights\" don't mean \"Open source.' Read the license!\n\nTake Meta's Llama 4. Its license requires a company with more than 700 million monthly active users to get a separate license from Meta.\n\nIf you offer a product or service that contains it, you must display",
